SUMMARY: Cavalry Episcopal Church Food Pantry
DESCRIPTION:  * Food is provided according to household size and selected
  by the clients themselves\, with the help of a volunteer shopping assist
 ant.\n  * Clients use shopping carts\, and volunteers escort them to thei
 r vehicles and help load their items.\n  * In addition to packaged foods\
 , fresh produce\, eggs\, milk\, bread\, and frozen meat is available.\n  
 * Provide roughly 3 1/2 meals worth of food per person per week.\n  * On 
 select Saturdays\, the UNC Eshelman School of Pharmacy and Walgreens offe
 r blood pressure checks and nutrition counseling.
